# Scroll animation assets: the site (js/scroll-*.js) serves ONLY the webp/
# folders. All the raw source frames, cutout attempts, backups, previews and
# inspection dumps (~715MB) stay on disk but must NOT be committed — they blow
# up the pack and make `git push` time out (HTTP 408). Whitelist just webp/.
assets/animations/scroll-*/**
!assets/animations/scroll-*/
!assets/animations/scroll-*/webp/
!assets/animations/scroll-*/webp/**

